      "content": "thanks. that helps a lot. for the first point about \"pseudoscientific correlation,\" can you expand on that? i want to get the specific details right for my essay. like, what kind of specific \"scientific\" evidence or theories were they actually citing at the time to claim that different races had different mental capabilities? i need to show how they tried to make it sound like a legitimate biological fact rather than just prejudice.",
